SUMMARY:🔧 Whizlabs Lab: Storage Account CLI Operations
DESCRIPTION:Hands-on CLI-intensive lab from Whizlabs\n\n🔗 https://www.whizlabs.com/learn/course/microsoft-azure-certification-az-104/298\n\n🛠️ LAB ACTIVITIES:\n• Create storage accounts via Azure CLI\n• Configure blob containers & access tiers\n• Generate SAS tokens with expiration\n• Configure storage firewalls & network rules\n• Enable diagnostic logging\n\n📝 COMMANDS TO MASTER:\naz storage account create\naz storage container create\naz storage blob upload\naz storage account generate-sas\naz storage account update (network rules)\n\n✅ GOAL: Build CLI muscle memory for storage operations
